Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 21:01:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] NOOVERLAP-C (web): Motor Test and Home Monitor overlaps
 removed (golden alBottom / FormShow)

EastSun 20260930: overlapping controls are not allowed.
- HW.MotorTest.html: Panel2 and palExit are Align=alBottom in golden
  (uMotorTest.dfm:66 / :3675) but were placed at a fixed top; the web
  TabSheet and form are 8 / 7 px taller than golden, so pnlMotor painted
  over the top 8px of Panel20/23/4 and PageControl1 ran 5px over palExit.
  Both are now anchored to the bottom. 24f2b4f's changes are untouched.
- HW.home.html: Panel2 (Reset OK / Exit) is hidden like golden FormShow
  (uhome.cpp:4846, only the home sequence :3516 shows it); Panel1 clips
  its children like a VCL panel (pnlLine1..3 are H=500 in the 460 panel).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
